{
  "$description": "Braventa design tokens — the single source of truth (D-009). Compile with `npm run tokens` in web/. Values use the W3C DTCG shape ($value/$type). References use {path.to.token}. Rationale for every value: docs/brand/VISUAL_IDENTITY.md and design-system/DESIGN_TOKENS.md.",
